## Coding Taste & Project Conventions (Auto-Learned)

### Architecture

- **[`src/**/*.entity.ts`]** Use custom @AutoEntity() and @AutoIndex() decorators instead of raw TypeORM @Entity() and @Index().
  - Avoid:

    ```
    @Entity('users')
    export class User {}
    ```

  - Prefer:

    ```
    @AutoEntity()
    export class User {}
    ```

- **[`src/**/*.controller.ts`]** Always return a standardized ApiResponse<T> wrapper from controller methods.
  - Avoid: `return this.userService.findAll();`
  - Prefer: `return ApiResponse.ok(await this.userService.findAll());`

### Code Style

- **[`**/*`]** Prefer early returns (guard clauses) over nested if-else blocks.

### Imports

- **[`src/**/*.ts`]** Import through the @/ path alias rather than deep relative paths.
  - Avoid: `import { User } from '../../users/user.entity';`
  - Prefer: `import { User } from '@/users/user.entity';`
